{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/70024","id":4987779585,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAQzde88AAAABKUt6AQ","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70024","diff_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70024.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/70024.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70024","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/70024/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/70024/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/70024/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/statuses/d3068c868d2fafeb5f3a37f94c4d8637ce063ed0","number":70024,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix NRE in RouteHandlerAnalyzer for delegate creation handlers","user":{"login":"AnsElgyarDev","id":198469824,"node_id":"U_kgDOC9RowA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/198469824?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev","html_url":"https://github.com/AnsElgyarDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnsElgyarDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Description\n\n`RouteHandlerAnalyzer` throws a `NullReferenceException` (AD0001) when the handler is passed as a delegate creation (`new Func<int, string>(Handlers.Size)`) or as a lambda under a cast (`(Func<int, string>)(size => ...)`).\n\nFor these shapes the semantic model returns no method symbol for the handler argument, so the route's `RouteUsageContext` is `default` and its `ResolvedParameters` is a default `ImmutableArray`. `IsRouteParameter` in `DisallowNonParsableComplexTypesOnParameters` then calls `FirstOrDefault` on it and throws.\n\n`IsRouteParameter` now returns `false` when `UsageContext.MethodSymbol` is null, matching how the other readers of `ResolvedParameters` (e.g. `RoutePatternAnalyzer`) guard before using it.\n\nAdded tests for both handler shapes.\n\nNote: I couldn't run the tests locally due to an SDK/environment issue on my machine, so I'm relying on CI.\n\nFixes #69760","labels":[{"id":1094843547,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDk0ODQzNTQ3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/area-infrastructure","name":"area-infrastructure","description":"Includes: MSBuild projects/targets, build scripts, CI, Installers and shared framework","color":"5319e7","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2209519932,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjA5NTE5OTMy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/community-contribution","name":"community-contribution","description":"Indicates that the PR has been added by a community member","color":"c2e0c6","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":5058451585,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAQzde88AAAABLYHYgQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/labels/pending-ci-rerun","name":"pending-ci-rerun","description":"When assigned to a PR indicates that the CI checks should be rerun","color":"B60205","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-23T18:53:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T01:29:08Z","closed_at":null,"m